		<meta name="description" content="In this episode, SBAI’s Brian Digney is joined by Jonathan Dimson, Senior Partner at McKinsey &amp; Company in London, where he leads the firm’s defence work across Europe. Jonathan explores the rapidly evolving European defence landscape, from the shifting tone at the Munich Security Conference to the growing gap between the clarity of US strategy and the more cautious, less coordinated approach across Europe. Against a backdrop of conflict in Ukraine and the Middle East, defence preparedness is becoming an increasingly urgent priority for governments and investors alike." />
	

	

	
